{
  "name": "loop-model-errors-network",
  "about": "provider 错误文案落到网络类与透传类归一化码（model/errors/normalizeModelError.ts:44-47 的优先级：classifyNetworkError 115-120 的文案匹配 → classifySemanticError 138-186 → 错误体自带的 code/type → statusCodeToCode 215-242）。每个会话一种，状态码都用 400：n1 ENOTFOUND→dns_error；n2 socket hang up→connection_reset；n3 ECONNREFUSED→connection_refused；n4 certificate→tls_error；n5 proxy error→proxy_error；n6 错误体 code=unknown 原样透传→unknown；n7 无法归类、没有 code/type→provider_error（241）；n8 ETIMEDOUT→timeout（178）。可重试的码（188-208）会被重试，退避设成 1ms。失败提示走 agent/loop/AgentLoop.ts:3560-3615 的分支。",
  "config": "schemaVersion: 1\nagent:\n  model: bbx/deterministic\n  maxContextTokens: 65536\n  maxOutputTokens: 8192\nmodel:\n  providers:\n    bbx:\n      protocol: openai\n      url: {MOCK}/v1\n      apiKey: bbx-mock-only\n      retry:\n        baseDelayMs: 1\n        maxDelayMs: 1\n        jitter: 0\n      models:\n        deterministic:\n          capabilities:\n            supportsToolUse: true\n            maxContextTokens: 65536\n            maxOutputTokens: 8192\ntelemetry:\n  enabled: false\n",
  "provider": [
    {
